%% alt: Swim-lane style flowchart of the whole chapter workflow. In the analyst lane, Lesson 1 gives the question and success criteria, which with the cleaning rules goes to three tool lanes. The pandas lane (Lesson 3) runs clean and answer. The Excel lane (Lesson 4) adds helper columns and a PivotTable. The Power BI lane (Lesson 5) applies Power Query steps and measures. All three answers return to the analyst lane in Lesson 6 for reconciliation, then the brief, and finally a re-run from the raw file that starts the loop again.
flowchart LR
  subgraph AN["Analyst lane"]
    direction LR
    Q["L1 Question +<br/>success criteria"] --> RU["L6 Rules R1-R5<br/>written once"]
    RC["L6 Reconcile<br/>three answers"] --> BR["L6 The brief"] --> RR["Re-run from<br/>the raw file"]
  end
  subgraph PY["pandas lane"]
    direction LR
    P1["L3 clean(df)"] --> P2["L3 answer(df)"]
  end
  subgraph XL["Excel lane"]
    direction LR
    X1["L4 Table + helper<br/>columns"] --> X2["L4 PivotTable<br/>and SUMIFS"]
  end
  subgraph PB["Power BI lane"]
    direction LR
    B1["L5 Power Query<br/>steps"] --> B2["L5 Measures<br/>+ visuals"]
  end
  RU --> P1
  RU --> X1
  RU --> B1
  P2 --> RC
  X2 --> RC
  B2 --> RC
  RR -. "next month, new question" .-> Q
